messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the sum of 719869 and 207192? Please reason step by step.', "<think>.\nTo solve the problem of finding the sum of 719869 and 207192, we can follow these steps:.\n1. Align the numbers by their place values, ensuring that the units, tens, hundreds, etc., are in the same columns.\n2. Add the numbers starting from the rightmost digit (units place) and move to the left.\n3. If the sum of any column exceeds 9, carry over the tens digit to the next column to the left.\n4. Continue this process until all columns have been added.\nLet's perform the addition:.\n```.\n  719869.\n+  207192.\n---------.\n```.\nStarting from the rightmost column (units place):.\n- 9 + 2 = 11. Write down 1 and carry over 1 to the next column.\n- 6 + 9 + 1 (carried over) = 16. Write down 6 and carry over 1 to the next column.\n- 8 + 1 + 1 (carried over) = 10. Write down 0 and carry over 1 to the next column.\n- 9 + 7 + 1 (carried over) = 17. Write down 7 and carry over 1 to the next column.\n- 1 + 0 + 1 (carried over) = 2. Write down 2.\n- 7 + 2 = 9. Write down 9.\nSo, the sum of 719869 and 207192 is 927061.\n</think>.\n<answer>. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
