messages:  [['Please solve the math problem.\nQuestion: What is the sum of 988598 and 941235? Please reason step by step.', "<think>.\nTo solve the problem of finding the sum of 988598 and 941235, we can follow these steps:.\n1. Align the numbers by their place values, making sure the digits in the same place value are in the same column.\n2. Add the digits starting from the rightmost column (units place) and move to the left.\n3. If the sum of digits in any column is 10 or more, carry over the tens digit to the next column to the left.\n4. Continue this process until all columns have been added.\n5. Finally, check the sum to ensure accuracy.\n</think>.\n<answer>.\nLet's perform the addition step by step:.\n```.\n  988598.\n+ 941235.\n---------.\n```.\nStarting from the rightmost column (units place):.\n- 8 + 5 = 13. Write down 3 and carry over 1.\n```.\n  988598.\n+ 941235.\n---------.\n      3.\n```.\nNext column (tens place):.\n- 9 + 3 + 1 (carried over) = 13. Write down 3 and carry over 1.\n```.\n  988598.\n+ 941235.\n---------.\n     33.\n```.\nNext column (hundreds place):.\n- 5 + 2 + 1 (carried over) = 8.\n```.\n  988598.\n+ 941235.\n---------.\n    833.\n```.\nNext column (thousands place):.\n- 8 + 4 = 12. Write down 2 and carry over 1.\n```.\n  988598.\n+ 941235.\n---------.\n   2833.\n```.\nNext column (ten thousands place):.\n- 8 + 9 + 1 (carried over) = 18. Write down 8 and carry over 1.\n```.\n  988598.\n+ 941235.\n---------.\n  82833.\n```.\nNext column (hundred thousands place):.\n- 9 + 9 = 18. Write down 8 and carry over 1.\n```.\n  988598.\n+ 941235.\n---------.\n 882833.\n```. Therefore, my final answer is: "]]
